.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-XENCPU 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-xencpu
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's xencpu plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP xencpu
\fBplugin\fP xencpu
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBxencpu\fP plugin collects metrics of hardware CPU load for machine
running Xen hypervisor.
The 'idle time' value provided by Xen is reported for each CPU (core)
as the counter \fBxen_cpu_idle_seconds\fP.
.Pp
This plugin doesn't have any options.
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
